L2424  The story of Tiananmen Square is one of cultural and historical significance. Located in the heart of Beijing, it is the site of numerous important events and celebrations in Chinese history. For example, Tiananmen Square is where the founding of the People’s Republic of China was declared in 1949, marking a new chapter in the nation’s history.
